<title>USA: CSI Computer Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>CSI Computer Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		   1996</p>
<p> Sales (in thousands)		  $ 5,264		$ 2,946</p>
<p>Earnings before taxes</p>
<p>  (in thousands)			     252		    203</p>
<p> Net income (in thousands)		 155		    125</p>
<p> Earnings per share			  .04		    .03</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997's increased revenues</p>
<p>reflect its acquistion of Cintronix Inc and Advanced</p>
<p>Network Systems, acquired in January and February,</p>
<p>respectively.</p>
<p>Full company name is CSI Computer Specialists Inc.</p>
</text>
